OL,3,GNEWSA'I entered event to see where I
OL,4,Awas at, and I won'
OL,5,
OL,6,FComedian Maisie Adam has reflected on
OL,7,Ffollowing in the footsteps of her
OL,8,Fcomedy heroes by winning a competition
OL,9,Fthat helped launch her career.
OL,11,FSince breaking into stand-up a decade
OL,12,Fago, Adam has become a regular on some
OL,13,Fof Britain's best-known comedy
OL,14,Ftelevision programmes.
OL,16,FAdam, who lives in Brighton, East
OL,17,FSussex, is to perform at the Marlowe
OL,18,FTheatre in Canterbury, Kent, and the
OL,19,FBrighton Comedy Festival this year with
OL,20,Fher new show, Whatsherface.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
