OL,3,GNEWSA'I entered event to see where I
OL,4,Awas at, and I won'
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe said that she had always had an
OL,7,Finterest in comedy and was urged to
OL,8,Ftake part in the 2017 edition of So You
OL,9,FThink You're Funny, a competition she
OL,10,Fwent on to win.
